WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:06.500
Imperial Father commanded me to uncover the full details of your rebellion. Confess voluntarily, and you may spare your flesh from torment.

00:06.960 --> 00:13.200
I led troops solely to pursue the embezzled relief provisions! You accuse me of treason—what evidence do you possess?!

00:13.600 --> 00:18.000
Evidence? The evidence is that entire depot filled with armor and military weapons!

00:19.200 --> 00:24.500
According to Great Xuan law: concealing ten suits of military armor is deemed outright treason!

00:25.400 --> 00:29.000
And what you harbored far exceeded that threshold!
